    <span class="pr-orn2__dots" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div class="pr-glow pr-glow--soft" style="width:520px;height:520px;right:-200px;top:-200px" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="pr-wrap">
      <div class="pr-head pr-head--center">
        <span class="pr-eyebrow" data-reveal>Website development</span>
        <h2 class="pr-h2" id="inc-h" data-reveal style="--d:1">Everything a pet business website needs, <em class="hl">design included</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="wd-feats">
        <article class="wd-feat" data-reveal data-spot style="--d:0"><span class="wd-feat__ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3a9 9 0 1 0 0 18c1.1 0 1.6-.8 1.6-1.6 0-1.2-1-1.5-1-2.6 0-.9.7-1.6 1.6-1.6H16a5 5 0 0 0 5-5C21 6.4 17 3 12 3z"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="11" r="1.2"/><circle cx="10" cy="7" r="1.2"/><circle cx="15" cy="7" r="1.2"/></svg></span><h3 class="pr-h3">Free website design</h3><p>We design your website for free. You only pay for development.</p></article>
        <article class="wd-feat" data-reveal data-spot style="--d:1"><span class="wd-feat__ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 17l6-6 4 4 8-8"/><path d="M15 7h6v6"/></svg></span><h3 class="pr-h3">Conversion-focused</h3><p>Every website is built to turn visitors into calls and bookings.</p></article>
        <article class="wd-feat" data-reveal data-spot style="--d:2"><span class="wd-feat__ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="4" width="13" height="10" rx="2"/><rect x="15" y="9" width="6" height="11" rx="1.5"/><path d="M7 18h5"/></svg></span><h3 class="pr-h3">Built around good UX</h3><p>Clear layouts that make it easy for visitors to find what they need.</p></article>
        <article class="wd-feat" data-reveal data-spot style="--d:3"><span class="wd-feat__ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.6-3 8.4-7 10-4-1.6-7-5.4-7-10V6z"/><path d="M8.5 12l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"/></svg></span><h3 class="pr-h3">One year of free support</h3><p>If the website has any issues during the first year, we’ll fix them.</p></article>
      </div>
      <div class="wd-pages" data-reveal>
        <div class="wd-pages__hd"><h3 class="pr-h3">Up to 5 pages in the standard website</h3><p>The typical page count for a standard small business website.</p></div>
        <ol class="wd-pages__row">
          <li class="wd-pg" style="--i:0"><span class="wd-pg__win" aria-hidden="true"><s></s><i class="lg"></i><i></i><em></em><i style="width:55%"></i></span><b><small>01</small>Home</b></li>
          <li class="wd-pg" style="--i:1"><span class="wd-pg__win" aria-hidden="true"><s></s><i class="lg"></i><i></i><em></em><i style="width:55%"></i></span><b><small>02</small>About</b></li>
          <li class="wd-pg" style="--i:2"><span class="wd-pg__win" aria-hidden="true"><s></s><i class="lg"></i><i></i><em></em><i style="width:55%"></i></span><b><small>03</small>Services</b></li>
          <li class="wd-pg" style="--i:3"><span class="wd-pg__win" aria-hidden="true"><s></s><i class="lg"></i><i></i><em></em><i style="width:55%"></i></span><b><small>04</small>Gallery or Reviews</b></li>
          <li class="wd-pg" style="--i:4"><span class="wd-pg__win" aria-hidden="true"><s></s><i class="lg"></i><i></i><em></em><i style="width:55%"></i></span><b><small>05</small>Contact</b></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="pr-sec pr-sec--white" aria-labelledby="ind-h">
    <div class="pr-ix-orn" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg class="pr-orn2__lines" viewBox="0 0 1440 700" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="#FF6A00" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M-80 560C260 380 520 620 860 400S1240 40 1560 160" stroke-opacity=".28" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M-80 640C280 460 540 700 880 480S1260 120 1560 240" stroke-opacity=".16" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M-80 480C240 300 500 540 840 320S1220 -40 1560 80" stroke-opacity=".12" stroke-width="1.5"/></g></svg>
      <span class="pr-orn2__dots"></span>
      <div class="pr-glow pr-glow--soft" style="width:560px;height:560px;right:-200px;top:-220px"></div>
