            <div class="pr-ix-cta"><a class="pr-ix-btn" href="/contact/">Book a Call</a><a class="pr-ix-arr" href="/contact/" aria-label="Book a call about a website for Veterinary Clinics"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8"/></svg></a></div>
            <div class="pr-ix-media"><img loading="lazy" width="708" height="458" src="/images/ind-vet-clinic.webp" alt="Veterinarian examining a happy golden retriever in a clinic"></div>
          </article>
          <article class="pr-ix-card pr-ix-card--b" data-reveal style="--d:1">
            <div class="pr-ix-top"><span class="pr-ix-n">02</span><h3 class="pr-ix-h">Pet Grooming</h3></div>
            <div class="pr-ix-cta"><a class="pr-ix-btn" href="/contact/">Book a Call</a><a class="pr-ix-arr" href="/contact/" aria-label="Book a call about a website for Pet Grooming"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8"/></svg></a></div>
            <div class="pr-ix-media"><img loading="lazy" width="463" height="459" src="/images/ind-dog-groomer.webp" alt="Groomer brushing a golden retriever in a grooming salon"></div>
          </article>
          <article class="pr-ix-card pr-ix-card--c" data-reveal style="--d:2">
            <div class="pr-ix-top"><span class="pr-ix-n">03</span><h3 class="pr-ix-h">Dog Training</h3></div>
            <div class="pr-ix-cta"><a class="pr-ix-btn" href="/contact/">Book a Call</a><a class="pr-ix-arr" href="/contact/" aria-label="Book a call about a website for Dog Training"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8"/></svg></a></div>
            <div class="pr-ix-media"><img loading="lazy" width="710" height="458" src="/images/ind-pet-trainer.webp" alt="Dog trainer giving a sit command to a golden retriever on a training field"></div>
          </article>
          <article class="pr-ix-card pr-ix-card--d" data-reveal style="--d:3">
            <div class="pr-ix-top"><span class="pr-ix-n">04</span><h3 class="pr-ix-h">Dog Daycare</h3></div>
            <div class="pr-ix-cta"><a class="pr-ix-btn" href="/contact/">Book a Call</a><a class="pr-ix-arr" href="/contact/" aria-label="Book a call about a website for Dog Daycare"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8"/></svg></a></div>
            <div class="pr-ix-media"><img loading="lazy" width="460" height="459" src="/images/ind-pet-boarding.webp" alt="Golden retriever relaxing on a bed in a dog daycare suite"></div>
          </article>
          <article class="pr-ix-card pr-ix-card--e" data-reveal style="--d:4">
            <div class="pr-ix-top"><span class="pr-ix-n">05</span><h3 class="pr-ix-h">Pet Franchise</h3></div>
            <div class="pr-ix-cta"><a class="pr-ix-btn" href="/contact/">Book a Call</a><a class="pr-ix-arr" href="/contact/" aria-label="Book a call about a website for Pet Franchise"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8"/></svg></a></div>
